---
import MizuLayout from '@/layouts/MizuLayout.astro'
---

<MizuLayout
  title="System Status | Pixelated Empathy"
  description="Operational status information for Pixelated Empathy."
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden pb-20 pt-32 lg:pb-28 lg:pt-40">
    <div class="site-shell site-shell--narrow relative z-10">
      <div class="mb-16 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-white mb-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-6xl">
          System Status
        </h1>
        <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-xl">
          A public real-time status feed is not published yet. During pilots and
          evaluations, operational updates are shared directly with the teams
          involved.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="bg-white/5 border-white/10 rounded-2xl border p-8 backdrop-blur-sm">
          <h2 class="text-white mb-3 text-xl font-bold">Operational updates</h2>
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            We share rollout and incident communication directly with active
            evaluation partners.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/5 border-white/10 rounded-2xl border p-8 backdrop-blur-sm">
          <h2 class="text-white mb-3 text-xl font-bold">Security questions</h2>
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            Teams that need deployment or support expectations can contact us
            directly for the current operating picture.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/5 border-white/10 rounded-2xl border p-8 backdrop-blur-sm">
          <h2 class="text-white mb-3 text-xl font-bold">Status history</h2>
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            We are avoiding placeholder uptime claims until a public status
            workflow is actually in place.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white/5 border-white/10 rounded-2xl border p-8 text-center backdrop-blur-sm md:p-12">
        <h2 class="text-white mb-4 text-3xl font-bold">Need an update?</h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-2xl text-muted-foreground">
          If you are evaluating the platform or waiting on a specific
          operational detail, send a note and we will answer directly.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-500 text-white shadow-primary-500/25 hover:shadow-primary-500/40 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl px-8 py-4 font-bold shadow-lg transition-all hover:-translate-y-1"
        >
          Contact us
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MizuLayout>
